{
  "job_A3.22.58_20260920_210248": {
    "chunk_text": "Ic wat anfete ellen dreogan wiht on wonge. Wide ne fere\u00f0, ne fela ride\u00f0, ne fleogan m\u00e6g \u00feurh scirne d\u00e6g, ne hie scip fere\u00f0, naca n\u00e6gledbord: nyt Hafa\u00f0 hefigne steort, heafod lytel, tungan lange, to\u00f0 n\u00e6nigne, isernes d\u00e6l; eor\u00f0gr\u00e6f p\u00e6\u00fee\u00f0. W\u00e6tan ne swelge\u00fe ne wiht ite\u00fe, fo\u00feres ne gitsa\u00f0, fere\u00f0 oft swa \u00feeah lagoflod on lyfte; life ne gielpe\u00f0, \u00dery sind in naman ryhte runstafas, \u00feara is Rad foran..",
